2 PAGE 1892-1917 Kirstrup, Rangers, Denmark Opslag 47   Banns and Marriage records  
2 DATA
3 TEXT #2  
4 CONT Bachelor Rasmus Jensen of Kristrup, born Kristrup 24 July 1876  
4 CONT son of Soren Jensen and his wife Birthe Rasmussen of Kristrup  25 years old 
