4 TEXT The State of Utah County of Box Elder Marriage License
5 CONT To any person legally authorized to solemnize marriage, greeting, you are hereby authorized to join in Holy Matrimony.
5 CONT Mr. Peter C. C. Peterson of Thatcher in the County of Box Elder and State of Utah of the age of twenty two years and Miss Tillie Peterson of Thatcher in the County of Box Elder and State of Utah of the age of twenty years.
5 CONT Witness my and and official seal this first day of May 1900 Geo S Gsaelil County Clerk Box Elder Bounty, Utah
5 CONT I hereby certify that on the 1st day of May in the year of our Lord one thousand nine hundred and 
5 CONT The State of Utah County of Box Elder at Brigham City in said County, I the undersigned a Justice of the Peace did join in the Holy Bonds of Matrimony according to law Peter C.C. Petersen of the County of Box Elder State of Utah and Miss Tillie Pet
5 CONC erson of the County of Box Elder State of Utah.  The nature of the ceremony was according to the rites.
5 CONT We were married as stated in this certificate and are now husband and wife Signed Peter C.C. Peterson groom  Miss Tillie Peterson bride in the presence of Mrs. Prescilla S. Jensen Mrs. Anna Compton.  Elias Jensen, Justice of the Peace
